.TH QUIPU-DOCTOR 1 "" quipu "Quipu Manual"
.SH NAME
quipu\-doctor \- Report graph\-label drift and recommended floors
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBquipu doctor\fR [\fB\-\-db\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fIsubcommands\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Report graph\-label drift and recommended floors
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-db\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Store file (default: .bobbin/quipu/quipu.db; configuration may override it)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
quipu\-doctor\-labels(1)
Report graph\-label drift and recommended floors
.TP
quipu\-doctor\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
